A NOTE ON WHAT IS AND IS NOT COVERED

This licence covers the original work in this repository: the selection and
organisation of instruments, the written summaries, the relationship mapping,
the interface design and the code.

It does not and cannot cover the underlying legal texts, which have their own
status. EU legislation published in the Official Journal is reusable under the
Commission's own terms. Council of Europe treaty texts are published by that
organisation. ISO/IEC standards are copyrighted works sold by ISO and its
national member bodies; this repository references clause numbers and published
titles only and reproduces no standard content.

Nothing here is legal advice.
